<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-eshghi-odonata-wing-cells-model-fidelity-second-assessor-gemini-4-argon> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Odonata wing cells through deep time — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Operationalises the scaling prediction of Hoffmann et al. (2018) (a fixed developmental inhibition radius r_in yields N ~ L^2 and median cell length ~ L^0) via log-log OLS regressions (ols_loglog) and replicates Eshghi et al.'s (2026) morphometric pipeline from raw fossil TIFFs by reading embedded scale bars, skeletonising veins, labelling connected interior regions, and measuring cell area, perimeter, circularity, and exact convex-hull maximum Feret diameter (_max_feret). Deducts 12 points because fossil_drawing() (used for rendering outlines, threshold < 128, largest connected component) and _read_drawing() (used for cell segmentation, threshold < 160, all wing components >= 150 px) use slightly different binarisation/component rules, and the statistical test is an observational scaling analysis rather than a mechanistic simulation." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
