<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-raup-shell-coiling-model-fidelity-second-assessor-gemini-4-argon> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raup shell coiling morphospace — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the logarithmic spiral growth law a(theta) = r0 * W^(theta / 2pi), generating-curve centre distance rc(theta) = a(theta)*(1+D)/(1-D) (yielding inner/outer margin ratio (rc - a)/(rc + a) = D), axial translation zc(theta) = T * rc(theta) (so dzc/drc = T Scales with whorl radius), and aperture shape S in the meridional plane through the coiling axis, verified to ~5e-15 by recover_parameters() in self_test(). Deducts 10 points because the standalone companion script 1966-raup.py hardcodes S = 1.0 and uses an unnormalised offset rc = r*(1+D) without (1-D) scaling." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
