    dct:date "2026-10-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions map cleanly to the mathematical formulations in Bookstein (1989) and Thompson (1917), with explicit docstrings specifying complex-plane equations, TPS kernel U(r) = r^2 log(r^2), partitioned system matrix L, and bending-energy eigen-decomposition, plus a 17-entry ANATOMICAL_LABELS dictionary mapping TPS indices to anatomical structures." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
