    dct:date "2026-10-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes per-landmark and RMS Procrustes residuals, leave-one-landmark-out cross-validation (LOO-CV), AIC-like parameter penalty, Bookstein's thin-plate spline bending energy (J = 0.258) and partial-warp spectrum (14 non-affine principal warps), plus rasterised silhouette Intersection-over-Union (IoU) and mean/95th-percentile symmetric boundary distances exported to thompson_outline_metrics.csv. Demonstrates quantitatively that Thompson's coaxial-circle family fails LOO-CV (0.0970 vs 0.0568 for similarity) and leaves silhouette IoU (0.6182) below baseline similarity (0.6615)." ;
